# Required behavior

Implement cents(mills) converting non-negative integer thousandths of a unit to integer hundredths. Round to nearest cent, with exact half-cent ties rounded upward. Inputs are at most 100000000.
===== end of SPEC.md =====

===== before.py =====
1| def cents(mills):
2|     return int(round(mills / 10))
===== end of before.py =====

===== candidate.py =====
1| def cents(mills):
2|     quotient, remainder = divmod(mills, 10)
3|     return quotient + (remainder > 5)
===== end of candidate.py =====

